warning: tab_on_hole: operation `o1`: tab `tab5` is on `Frame 1` (instance `i1`, profile 1), which this operation cuts as a hole, so the tab holds the hole's slug in place; the slug is usually waste, so remove the tab (`dreamcarve tabs clear <dcv> --tab tab5`) unless you mean to keep the slug
